      "result": "Implemented the persistent URL shortener API with PostgreSQL-backed links and click counts. `sh start.sh` applies migrations and starts the server on `0.0.0.0:8000`; startup instructions are in the README.\n\nVerified the API with Rails integration tests: **5 tests, 33 assertions, all passing**. I also exercised create, duplicate rejection, redirect location, click counting, and malformed JSON over HTTP, including checking that data persisted after restarting the server. The smoke-test server is stopped so it won’t conflict with your check.\n\n**Implementation note:** Added a JSON gem version constraint after the latest JSON release caused Rails JSON rendering to error.",
